adow-lg hover:shadow-ink/5 transition-[border-color,box-shadow]\"><div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-mint text-teal-dark flex items-center justify-center\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-sparkles w-5 h-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M11.017 2.814a1 1 0 0 1 1.966 0l1.051 5.558a2 2 0 0 0 1.594 1.594l5.558 1.051a1 1 0 0 1 0 1.966l-5.558 1.051a2 2 0 0 0-1.594 1.594l-1.051 5.558a1 1 0 0 1-1.966 0l-1.051-5.558a2 2 0 0 0-1.594-1.594l-5.558-1.051a1 1 0 0 1 0-1.966l5.558-1.051a2 2 0 0 0 1.594-1.594z\"></path><path d=\"M20 2v4\"></path><path d=\"M22 4h-4\"></path><circle cx=\"4\" cy=\"20\" r=\"2\"></circle></svg></div><p class=\"font-display font-bold text-ink mt-4\">Scaling &amp; Cleaning</p><p class=\"text-sm text-ink/60 mt-2 leading-relaxed\">Routine polish and plaque removal to keep gums healthy between checkups.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(28px)\"><div class=\"h-full\" tabindex=\"0\"><div class=\"h-full rounded-2xl border border-line p-6 hover:border-teal/40 hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-ink/5 transition-[border-color,box-shadow]\"><div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-mint text-teal-dark flex items-center justify-center\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-sun w-5 h-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"4\"></circle><path d=\"M12 2v2\"></path><path d=\"M12 20v2\"></path><path d=\"m4.93 4.93 1.41 1.41\"></path><path d=\"m17.66 17.66 1.41 1.41\"></path><path d=\"M2 12h2\"></path><path d=\"M20 12h2\"></path><path d=\"m6.34 17.66-1.41 1.41\"></path><path d=\"m19.07 4.93-1.41 1.41\"></path></svg></div><p class=\"font-display font-bold text-ink mt-4\">Teeth Whitening</p><p class=\"text-sm text-ink/60 mt-2 leading-relaxed\">Brighten your smile with an in-clinic whitening treatment.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(28px)\"><div class=\"h-full\" tabindex=\"0\"><div class=\"h-full rounded-2xl border border-line p-6 hover:border-teal/40 hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-ink/5 transition-[border-color,box-shadow]\"><div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-mint text-teal-dark flex items-center justify-center\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-activity w-5 h-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M22 12h-2.48a2 2 0 0 0-1.93 1.46l-2.35 8.36a.25.25 0 0 1-.48 0L9.24 2.18a.25.25 0 0 0-.48 0l-2.35 8.36A2 2 0 0 1 4.49 12H2\"></path></svg></div><p class=\"font-display font-bold text-ink mt-4\">Root Canal Treatment</p><p class=\"text-sm text-ink/60 mt-2 leading-relaxed\">Save a damaged or infected tooth and relieve pain at the source.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(28px)\"><div class=\"h-full\" tabindex=\"0\"><div class=\"h-full rounded-2xl border border-line p-6 hover:border-teal/40 hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-ink/5 transition-[border-color,box-shadow]\"><div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-mint text-teal-dark flex items-center justify-center\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield-check w-5 h-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg></div><p class=\"font-display font-bold text-ink mt-4\">Crowning &amp; Capping</p><p class=\"text-sm text-ink/60 mt-2 leading-relaxed\">Restore a weakened tooth&#x27;s strength, shape, and appearance.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(28px)\"><div class=\"h-full\" tabindex=\"0\"><div class=\"h-full rounded-2xl border border-line p-6 hover:border-teal/40 hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-ink/5 transition-[border-color,box-shadow]\"><div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-mint text-teal-dark flex items-center justify-center\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-layers w-5 h-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12.83 2.18a2 2 0 0 0-1.66 0L2.6 6.08a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.83l8.58 3.91a2 2 0 0 0 1.66 0l8.58-3.9a1 1 0 0 0 0-1.83z\"></path><path d=\"M2 12a1 1 0 0 0 .58.91l8.6 3.91a2 2 0 0 0 1.65 0l8.58-3.9A1 1 0 0 0 22 12\"></path><path d=\"M2 17a1 1 0 0 0 .58.91l8.6 3.91a2 2 0 0 0 1.65 0l8.58-3.9A1 1 0 0 0 22 17\"></path></svg></div><p class=\"font-display font-bold text-ink mt-4\">Dentures (Fixed &amp; Removable)</p><p class=\"text-sm text-ink/60 mt-2 leading-relaxed\">Comfortable replacements for missing teeth, custom-fitted.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(28px)\"><div class=\"h-full\" tabindex=\"0\"><div class=\"h-full rounded-2xl border border-line p-6 hover:border-teal/40 hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-ink/5 transition-[border-color,box-shadow]\"><div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-mint text-teal-dark flex items-center justify-center\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-smile w-5 h-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path 