8.12 12 12\"></path><path d=\"M20 4 8.12 15.88\"></path><circle cx=\"6\" cy=\"18\" r=\"3\"></circle><path d=\"M14.8 14.8 20 20\"></path></svg></div><p class=\"font-display font-bold text-ink mt-4\">Surgical Treatment</p><p class=\"text-sm text-ink/60 mt-2 leading-relaxed\">Extractions and minor oral surgery performed with care.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"bg-sand py-20 md:py-28\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 md:px-8\"><div class=\"max-w-lg mb-14\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(28px)\"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold tracking-wide uppercase text-teal-dark\">Getting an appointment</p><h2 class=\"font-display font-extrabold text-3xl md:text-4xl text-ink mt-2 leading-tight\">Three steps, mostly on WhatsApp.</h2></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-10\"><div class=\"relative\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(28px)\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><span class=\"font-display font-extrabold text-2xl text-teal/30\">0<!-- -->1</span><div class=\"w-9 h-9 rounded-full bg-white border border-line flex items-center justify-center text-teal-dark shrink-0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-message-circle w-4 h-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M2.992 16.342a2 2 0 0 1 .094 1.167l-1.065 3.29a1 1 0 0 0 1.236 1.168l3.413-.998a2 2 0 0 1 1.099.092 10 10 0 1 0-4.777-4.719\"></path></svg></div></div><p class=\"font-display font-bold text-ink mt-4\">Message us on WhatsApp</p><p class=\"text-sm text-ink/60 mt-2 leading-relaxed\">Tell us what you need and your preferred day or time — no phone tag, no forms.</p></div><div class=\"relative\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(28px)\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><span class=\"font-display font-extrabold text-2xl text-teal/30\">0<!-- -->2</span><div class=\"w-9 h-9 rounded-full bg-white border border-line flex items-center justify-center text-teal-dark shrink-0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-calendar-check w-4 h-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M8 2v3\"></path><path d=\"M16 2v3\"></path><rect x=\"3\" y=\"3\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" rx=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M3 9h18\"></path><path d=\"m9 15 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg></div></div><p class=\"font-display font-bold text-ink mt-4\">We confirm your slot</p><p class=\"text-sm text-ink/60 mt-2 leading-relaxed\">We reply with a confirmed time that works around our morning and evening shifts.</p></div><div class=\"relative\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(28px)\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><span class=\"font-display font-extrabold text-2xl text-teal/30\">0<!-- -->3</span><div class=\"w-9 h-9 rounded-full bg-white border border-line flex items-center justify-center text-teal-dark shrink-0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-map-pin w-4 h-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg></div></div><p class=\"font-display font-bold text-ink mt-4\">Visit the clinic</p><p class=\"text-sm text-ink/60 mt-2 leading-relaxed\">Find us on Market Road, Latifabad Unit 10 — walk-ins welcome if we have space.</p></div></div></div></section><section class=\"py-20 md:py-28\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 md:px-8 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-10\"><div class=\"\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(28px)\"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold tracking-wide uppercase text-teal-dark\">Why patients choose us</p><h2 class=\"font-display font-extrabold text-3xl md:text-4xl text-ink mt-2 leading-tight\">A clinic built around your neighborhood, not a waiting room.</h2></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl bg-mint p-6\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(28px)\"><div class=\"w-9 h-9 rounded-full bg-white text-teal-dark flex items-center justify-center\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-clock w-4 h-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"M12 6v6l4 2\"></path></svg></div><p class=\"font-display font-bold text-ink mt-4\">Two shifts, daily</p><p class=\"text-sm text-ink/60 mt-2 leading-relaxed\">Morning and evening hours mean you can find a time that fits your day.</p></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl bg-mint p-6\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(28px)\"><div class=\"w-9 h-9 rounded-full bg-white text-teal-dark flex items-center justify-center\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-message-circle w-4 h-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M2.992 16.342a2 2 0 0 1 .094 1.167l-1.065 3.29a1 1 0 0 0 1.236 1.168l3.413-.998a2 2 0 0 1 1.099.092 10 10 0 1 0-4.777-4.719\"></path></svg></div><p class=\"font-display font-bold text-ink mt-4\">Message before you visit</p><p class=\"text-sm text-ink/60 mt-2 leading-relaxed\">Reach us on WhatsApp for questions, appointment requests, or directions.</p></div></div></section><section class=\"mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 md:px-8 pb-20 md:pb-28\"><div class=\"relative overflow-hidden rounded-tl-[3rem] rounded-br-[3rem] rounded-tr-2xl rounded-bl-2xl bg-ink text-white px-8 py-14 md:px-16 md:py-20 text-center\